# Foreman Okafor, EBI warehouse shift in the industrial district. Client of "Shift Change".
# The same file serves his EBI-appointed replacement (foreman_ebi_loyal) once b_foreman_replaced is set.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('b_foreman_replaced')
goto: Loyal

cond: HasFlag('shift_change(returned)') || HasFlag('shift_change(sold_out)')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('b_shift_accepted')
goto: Return

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He looks past you at the guards, then back.) You're not EBI. Good. Keep your voice down.
#
o_text: You look like a man with a problem.
o_id: ask_job
o_goto: Job
#
o_text: Just passing.
o_id: default_bye
o_goto: End

name: Job
npc: A pallet of medical supplies walked off my dock last week. Gun thugs, commerce district, the ones outside the Bastards' hall.
+ EBI counts the inventory on Monday. If the count is short, I'm the one who's short. Bring it back and nobody up there hears a word.
+ Three hundred and fifty. Quiet money.
#
o_text: Quiet money. Done.
o_id: accept_shift
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my problem.
o_id: decline_shift
o_goto: End

name: Return
npc: (Quietly.) Well?
#
o_text: Here. Sealed, like it left.
o_id: give_supplies
o_cond: HasItem('medical_supplies')
o_goto: Returned
#
o_text: Working on it.
o_id: return_bye
o_goto: End

name: Returned
npc: (He checks the seal, then breathes out.) Monday's count is right. You were never here.
+ Three fifty. Thank you.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'medical_supplies')
effect: PlayerAddGold(350)
effect: SetFlag('shift_change(returned)')
#
o_text: Never was.
o_id: returned_bye
o_goto: End

name: Done
npc: (A nod. Nothing more, with the guards this close.)
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: done_bye
o_goto: End

name: Loyal
npc: Shift two is under new management. Inventory is correct to the unit. Move along, citizen.
#
o_text: What happened to Okafor?
o_id: ask_okafor
o_goto: Okafor
#
o_text: Moving.
o_id: loyal_bye
o_goto: End

name: Okafor
npc: Reassigned. (He does not say where.) Eschaton thanks you for your cooperation.
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: okafor_bye
o_goto: End

name: Accepted
npc: (He goes back to his clipboard a little too quickly.)
effect: SetFlag('b_shift_accepted')
effect: EndConversation

name: End
npc: (He turns back to his clipboard.)
effect: EndConversation
